{
  "schema": "ce.characters.v1",
  "note": [
    "The bridge between the three names every character has. There is no rule that",
    "derives one from another: sf6-sensei writes ChunLi as \"chunli\" and DeeJay as",
    "\"dee_jay\", so removing the separator is right for one and wrong for the other.",
    "A lowercase() of the catalog name gets 3 of 31 wrong, silently, by asking for a",
    "file that does not exist.",
    "",
    "Derived once by matching on the letters alone (case and separators removed),",
    "verified as a 31-to-31 bijection, and then FROZEN here. It is not re-derived at",
    "build time on purpose: if either side renames a character, this file should stop",
    "matching and say so, rather than quietly re-deriving to something new.",
    "",
    "fighter_id is Capcom's own numbering. It is what _meta.fighter_id carries in every",
    "command_display file and what the runtime's _shared_player_info.id reports, so it",
    "is the one identifier that is not a filename convention."
  ],
  "verified_on": "2026-09-11",
  "verified_against": {
    "catalog_dir": "reframework/data/TrainingComboTrials_data/command_display",
    "sensei_repository": "RyoSogawa/sf6-sensei",
    "sensei_dir": "packages/data/src/generated",
    "sensei_commit": "a64f2acf90fffc855ddc1a958a4ee752e15c571c"
  },
  "paths": {
